01-Work/codebase-wiki/azifexlab-net/202609101615-chat-guardrails-reminder-only-refusals-soft-plus-hard-enforc.md
  Chat guardrails: reminder-only refusals, soft plus hard enforcement
  Decision: scope redirects/refusals end with exactly one fixed purpose reminder ("I'm Aziz's portfolio assistant ...") and MUST NOT offer follow-up questions/chips (AC-402/AC-701 updated accordingly; stub unknown-case links removed). Guardrails are two-layer: soft (system-prompt wording) + hard deterministic (H-1 client pre-check, H-2 3-strikes/10min -> 5min composer lock persisted in localStorage, H-4 output post-filter replacing leaks, H-5 2000-char cap). Denylists stay server-side in future agent, never in client bundle.

