id: 202609141128
title: Defer FCM-APNs push, foreground RTDB listener covers active use
segment: work
project: mindscape
tags: [mindscape, notifications, push, fcm, rtdb]
created: 2026-09-14
---

Foreground RTDB listener on notifications/{uid} covers open and backgrounded-but-open tabs; no JS runs when tab closed/app killed.
True background needs push: register device tokens at pushTokens/{uid}, send via Admin messaging() inside notify* fan-out, receive via SW on web / expo-notifications on native (VAPID key already in env).
Decision: defer push slice until e2e flows stable; foreground listener + list auto-refresh is enough for now.

Related: [[202609141111-notifications-fan-out-per-user-no-shared-inbox-collection]]

Parent: [[01-Work/mindscape/mindscape|mindscape]]
=====
---
id: 202609141130
title: Push-notifications slice specced in PRD, 3 phases
segment: work
project: mindscape
tags: [mindscape, push, notifications, fcm, prd]
created: 2026-09-14
---

Spec: docs/PRD-push-notifications.md — 3 phases.

Phase 1 server standalone: PUT/DELETE /api/push-tokens per-uid RTDB registry + PushGateway port into existing notify* fan-out, best-effort with invalid-token pruning.
Phase 2 web client: standalone firebase-messaging-sw.js, register-on-login, foreground into existing popup/refresh, delete-on-logout.
Phase 3 native: expo-notifications getDevicePushTokenAsync raw FCM, Android first, iOS out of v1, google-services.json ops prerequisite (gitignored).

Contracts: inbox-write-before-push, push-never-fails-request, tap targets reuse targetForNotification, 16-item acceptance AC-101...AC-402.

Related: [[202609141128-defer-fcm-apns-push-foreground-rtdb-listener-covers-active-u]], [[202609141111-notifications-fan-out-per-user-no-shared-inbox-collection]]

Parent: [[01-Work/mindscape/mindscape|mindscape]]
=====
