id: 202609141128
title: Defer FCM-APNs push, foreground RTDB listener covers active use
segment: work
project: mindscape
tags: [mindscape, notifications, push, fcm, rtdb]
created: 2026-09-14
---

Foreground RTDB listener on notifications/{uid} covers open and backgrounded-but-open tabs; no JS runs when tab closed/app killed.
True background needs push: register device tokens at pushTokens/{uid}, send via Admin messaging() inside notify* fan-out, receive via SW on web / expo-notifications on native (VAPID key already in env).
Decision: defer push slice until e2e flows stable; foreground listener + list auto-refresh is enough for now.

Related: [[202609141111-notifications-fan-out-per-user-no-shared-inbox-collection]]

