title: Booking date slots need polling until Memuat ketersediaan clears
segment: work
repo: mindscape
tags: [mindscape, playwright, e2e, booking]
created: 2026-09-14
---

Booking modal shows 'Memuat ketersediaan…' while date slots load. Reading slots once races it and fails date validation.
Fix: Playwright spec polls up to 15s until slots actually render.
If still failing, check DEBUG=pw:api logs + modal screenshot to distinguish still-loading vs empty slot day vs wrong-text match.

