Admin dashboard done per v2/docs/plans/admin-dashboard.md (AC-001..AC-033).
API: /api/admin/* behind RBAC('admin'); UserRole+=admin; listUsers/updateRole with SELF_DEMOTE+LAST_ADMIN guards; ClientAssignmentService.setCounselors full-replace; SupervisionService.setSupervision via counselor.readOnlyPsychologistIds[]; AdminService list/book/accept/cancel.
