  Design-system Button has no button role on web - use text tap in Playwright
  design-system Button is a bare Pressable with no accessibilityRole, so on web it renders as a plain div with no role="button". Playwright getByRole('button') hangs waiting and never clicks (seen with "Lanjutkan"). Fix: tap exact label text in tests/ui.ts instead - click bubbles to onPress. OTP boxes are real inputs so getByRole('textbox') remains valid.

