  Decision for ezfinn MVP APIs (from docs/prd/mvp.md): Hono + hexagonal (src/core, service, adapters/dto+mapper, handlers, app.ts:createApp), single Vercel catch-all api/[[route]].ts via hono/vercel (nodejs runtime).

