01-Work/ezfinn/202609242200-ai-ledger-authority-boundary.md
  AI ledger authority boundary
  EzFin’s AI-assisted finance flow must treat the ledger/API as the authoritative source of truth. AI interprets text or receipts into proposals; validation and execution happen in code/API, and record mutations require user confirmation. Balances and financial metrics must be calculated from ledger data, not generated by the model.

