01-Work/ezfinn/202609242152-opencode-adapter-requires-stable-session-headers.md
  OpenCode adapter requires stable session headers
  The ezfinn OpenCode adapter must send `User-Agent: opencode/{OPENCODE_CLI_VERSION}`, `x-opencode-client: opencode-cli`, and a stable UUID in `x-opencode-session` on API calls. Reuse the same session ID across continuation requests; never generate a new ID per request. Keep provider-specific header construction inside the OpenCode adapter. The current CLI-version alignment is `1.32.4`.

