01-Work/codebase-wiki/ezfinn/202609300010-channel-confirmation-replay-after-failed-write.md
  Channel confirmation replay after failed write
  When a pending write confirmation returns a failed result, Channel leaves the pending action in place. Subsequent standalone "yes" messages can invoke the same tool again with the saved arguments and idempotency key; no retry limit spans separate messages, so the user can get stuck in a confirmation loop until the pending state is cleared or confirmation handling changes.

