Contract-driven Go backend done: contracts/openapi.yaml (3.0.3) -> internal/contracts/api.gen.go (echo-server), drift-guarded. go build, go vet, 4 tests, contracts-gen-check green + HTTP smoke.
Hexagonal: service OTP/booking/conversation/demo + pure contact/intent/confirmation/date parsers, sqlite real DB, email_smtp + wa_whatsmeow senders, Echo ServerInterface, WA state-machine, web/admin viewer with OTP-mode label + reset.
Reviewer found 9 load-bearing issues, fixed 8: AC-14 write-time gate, strict idempotency + selection cleared, OTP ns ordering, okay/hedge rejection, explicit confirm text, [MOCK OTP] inbox, DB cutoff, concrete-date parsing (besok/Sabtu).
Gaps: whatsmeow QR pairing + debounce/presence unwired (client nil), multi-statement writes mutex-serialized not transactional, orchestration in WA handler not service.
Next: go get go.mau.fi/whatsmeow + pair, then E2E AC-01..AC-15 over test number.

