id: 202609302148
title: demo-wa-assistant two-layer LLM boundary
segment: work
project: demo-wa-assistant
tags: [demo-wa-assistant, llm, whatsapp, hexagonal]
created: 2026-09-30
---

Layer1 parser (llm_opencode adapter): text to deepseek-v4.1-flash via /chat/completions (thinking disabled, temp 0), images to gpt-6-luna via /responses (reasoning none, temp 0). Session headers + separate provider params, dormant without key with rule-based fallback.
Layer2 conversation (services + WA handler) receives only structured parser output + caption, never image bytes. Model gets zero tools; code matcher gates writes; replies templated not model-phrased.
Verified: 11 tests green, build/vet/drift clean. Limits: no live call yet (needs OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY), whatsmeow QR pairing pending for true E2E.

