Parser is stateful per WA session: deterministic x-opencode-session UUID per conversation (same id across continuations, isolates users).
Client keeps last 5 parsed turns per session as Riwayat sesi ini prepended to next call, so follow-ups like yang sore resolve.
Explicit intent+booking still forwarded belt-and-suspenders if remote ignores session state.
Idle sessions evicted after 1h, cap 1000.
Verified: 13 tests incl same-session reuse, cross-session isolation, no history leak.

