id: 202610011144
title: Live harness with code-gated writes
segment: work
project: demo-wa-assistant
tags: [whatsapp, harness, llm-agent, fail-closed]
created: 2026-10-01
---

WhatsApp booking bot now runs live LLM harness instead of scripted flow.
Skills embedded in binary (communication + whatsapp-format) composed every turn with live backend facts.
8 allowlisted tools only: get_bookings, request_otp, verify_otp, list_slots, select_booking, select_slot, propose_cancel, propose_reschedule. Max 3 calls/turn, 4 iterations; unknown/excess/empty/LLM-error falls back to deterministic flow.
Writes code-gated: no execute tool; propose_* only builds summary, standalone "ya" matched by code pre-gate runs Cancel/Reschedule. OTP codes bypass model. Same-number→email and tool-markup suppression enforced in tool execution.
Verified: build, vet, 22 guardrail tests pass, no contract drift.
