id: 202610011112
title: WhatsApp LID senders must be accepted alongside s.whatsapp.net
segment: work
repo: demo-wa-assistant
tags: [whatsapp, lid, whatsmeow]
created: 2026-10-01
---

Modern WhatsApp often delivers DMs from @lid addresses instead of @s.whatsapp.net.
Filter accepting only s.whatsapp.net silently drops messages before handler with nothing logged.
Fix: accept both sender domains, log filtered messages with reason (wa drop line) to show exact cause.

