===== /Users/azizf/Documents/volta/01-Work/codebase-wiki/demo-wa-assistant/202610011112-whatsapp-logout-deletes-device-row-use-fresh-device-before-r.md =====
---
id: 202610011112
title: WhatsApp Logout deletes device row, use fresh device before re-pair
segment: work
repo: demo-wa-assistant
tags: [whatsapp, logout, whatsmeow]
created: 2026-10-01
---

Logout deletes the device row, so reconnecting the same client fails with 'invalid use of deleted device'.
Fix: swap in a fresh device before re-pairing; same handling for remote logouts.
Saved session can then reconnect with connected:true same number, no re-pair needed.

Related: [[202610011112-whatsapp-lid-senders-must-be-accepted-alongside-s-whatsapp-n|WhatsApp LID senders must be accepted alongside s.whatsapp.net]]

