===== /Users/azizf/Documents/volta/01-Work/codebase-wiki/demo-wa-assistant/202610011128-wa-otp-contact-loop-intent-swallowed-contact.md =====
---
id: 202610011128
title: WA OTP contact loop - intent swallowed contact
segment: work
repo: demo-wa-assistant
tags: [demo-wa-assistant, whatsapp, otp, contact-extraction]
created: 2026-10-01
---

WA assistant asked for email/phone in a loop: contact replies were classified as intent=reschedule every time, and the LLM-extracted contact was dropped.
Fix: ExtractContact finds email/phone anywhere in reply (not bare-only; excludes short digit runs like OTP codes/picks), contact-first flow verifies immediately same-turn before intent classification, LLM contact re-validated through same extractor so hallucinations become empty.
Rule: entity extraction must run before intent classification, or intent swallows the entity.

Parent: [[01-Work/codebase-wiki/demo-wa-assistant/demo-wa-assistant|demo-wa-assistant]]

===== /Users/azizf/Documents/volta/01-Work/codebase-wiki/demo-wa-assistant/202610011153-gateway-rejects-required-null-on-parameterless-tools.md =====
---
id: 202610011153
title: Gateway rejects required null on parameterless tools
segment: work
repo: demo-wa-assistant
tags: [gateway, 400, tools]
created: 2026-10-01
---

Agent turns 400'd while llm text parsed succeeded, ruling out endpoint, key, and thinking disabled.
Cause: tool definitions sent "required": null for parameterless tools (get_bookings, list_slots), which the gateway rejects.
Fix: omit required when empty; redeployed with reconnect (no re-pair).
If 400 persists, next suspect is parallel_tool_calls.

Parent: [[01-Work/codebase-wiki/demo-wa-assistant/demo-wa-assistant|demo-wa-assistant]]

