id: 202610011753
title: demo-wa-assistant per-token COGS refines Rp100 flat
segment: work
project: demo-wa-assistant
supersedes: 202610011616-demo-wa-assistant-cogs-rp100-per-llm-call
tags: [cogs, llm-cost, pricing, deepseek]
created: 2026-10-01
---

Per-token COGS replaces Rp100/call flat: COGS = SUM[(in_tok*0.30+out_tok*1.20)/1M*16500], Gross = 2000-COGS.
Typical chat 7k in+500 out => ~Rp45 (97.7% gross); max 4 iter 24k+4k => ~Rp198 (90%); 80% cache-hit (/bin/zsh.006) => ~Rp12.
Ceiling from harness: parser max_tokens 300, reply cap 600 chars (~150-200 tok), max 4 iter/chat. DeepSeek V4.1 Flash peak /bin/zsh.30/.20.

Supersedes: [[202610011616-demo-wa-assistant-cogs-rp100-per-llm-call]]
Reason: Per-token calc shows flat Rp100 was ~2x conservative; replace flat rate with usage-based computation

Parent: [[01-Work/demo-wa-assistant/demo-wa-assistant|demo-wa-assistant]]
