COGS Rp300/chat otomatis (3 LLM x Rp100); Starter 90% otomasi = 270 auto -> COGS ~Rp81rb, margin ~84%.
Cerita klien: 270 chat via CS = 270 x Rp15.000 = Rp4.050jt vs Rp499rb -> hemat ~Rp3,5jt/bln + 24/7 instan. Tabel pinned di dashboard.

