**`[[202610020717-login-infinite-refresh-from-hx-get-auth-fragment]]`** (`01-Work/codebase-wiki/demo-wa-assistant/`):
> htmx `hx-get="/auth/me"` on `login.html` + `401 HX-Redirect → /login.html` = infinite refresh loop. Fix: fragment removed from login, kept only in page-guarded `index.html`. Rule: never embed an auth-guarded redirecting fragment on the login page itself.

Skipped the login-page restyle (landing-page palette/tone) — implementation detail visible in code, not a reusable decision.
