[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"\nconst body = `Decision (demo-wa-assistant): the per-tool auth requirement must not live in the harness switch; it moves onto the API catalog row, per API and per tenant.\n\nEach catalog row (APIDef) carries RequiresAuth; describe_apis returns it so the model knows to do auth first (minta kontak -> request_otp) instead of calling blind, and call_api enforces it in one place: resolve catalog row -> if RequiresAuth && !session verified -> BELUM_VERIFIKASI / SESI_KEDALUWARSA (reuse verifyFail() text) -> else run hook chain.\n\nSalon get_bookings ships RequiresAuth:true, get_today false. New client plugins register new catalog rows with no harness change. Per-tenant override: same API false on public demo tenant, true on prod. The current 13 tools become the first 13 catalog rows.\n\nStatus: design agreed, registry interface + describe_apis/call_api shapes against internal/core/ports/ports.go not yet drafted/implemented.`;\n\nconst res = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment: \"work\",\n  project: \"demo-wa-assistant\",\n  memory_type: \"decision\",\n  title: \"demo-wa-assistant auth requirement lives on the API catalog row (RequiresAuth), not the harness switch\",\n  body,\n  tags: \"demo-wa-assistant, auth, api-catalog, harness, multi-tenancy\",\n  links: \"202610011144-demo-wa-assistant-live-harness-with-code-gated-writes, 202610011256-demo-wa-assistant-service-catalog-with-two-layer-validation\",\n  entities: [{ name: \"demo-wa-assistant\", type: \"Project\" }],\n});\nreturn res;\n"} 
