[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"const body1 = `Seatap M2a (stp-api) adds a browser cookie boundary as dedicated routes: POST /v1/web/auth/login, /register, /logout — native bearer endpoints keep exact responses and emit no cookie.\nCookie \\`seatap_session\\`: HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict, Path=/, no Domain, Max-Age=2592000 (30d), Secure only when NODE_ENV=production (wired in runtime.ts). Web responses return public user + household + expiresAt (WebSession schema), never the token.\nProtected routes accept cookie OR strict bearer; both present -> 403 (no silent pick), invalid header never falls back to cookie. Cookie value must match stp_[a-f0-9]{64}. Auth + operation stay in one Postgres transaction via executeAuthenticated.\nAll web auth routes plus every unsafe cookie-authenticated request require an exact trusted Origin from configured allowed origins (missing/null/untrusted -> 403); CORS is not the CSRF defense. GETs are Origin-free. Generated app/src/generated/api.ts changes only via the generator.\nContract-first: src/contracts/index.ts declares webRoutes + cookieAuth apiKey scheme, then npm run contracts:gen. Predecessor: M1a bearer auth (commit a9ee993).`;\nconst body2 = `In stp-api the Hono/OpenAPI layer throws HTTPException 415 for a wrong content-type before the route handler runs, so handler-level checks never fire.\nFix used in M2a: a scoped mapping in onError converting 415 -> 400 only for /v1/web/auth/* paths. Native routes still surface the framework 415 as a generic 500 (pre-existing, left out of scope).\nTesting it: assert application/json enforcement with media-type parameters allowed, and keep the mapping path-scoped so other routes are untouched.`;\nconst [n1] = await Promise.all([\n  tools.second_brain.create_note({\n    segment:\"work\", repo:\"seatap\", type:\"decision\",\n    title:\"Seatap M2a: cookie auth on dedicated /v1/web/auth routes\",\n    body: body1,\n    tags:\"auth,cookie,csrf,api,stp-api\",\n    links:\"01-Work/codebase-wiki/seatap/202610182112-seatap-auth-api-register-login-household-and-invitations.md\",\n    memory_type:\"decision\",\n    entities:[{name:\"Seatap\",type:\"Project\"},{name:\"stp-api\",type:\"Repository\"},{name:\"Hono\",type:\"Technology\"}],\n    relations:[{source:\"Seatap\",type:\"USES\",target:\"stp-api\"},{source:\"stp-api\",type:\"BUILT_WITH\",target:\"Hono\"}]\n  })\n]);\nconst n2 = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment:\"work\", repo:\"seatap\", type:\"fact\",\n  title:\"stp-api: Hono throws 415 before handler on wrong content-type\",\n  body: body2,\n  tags:\"hono,openapi,error-handling,stp-api\",\n  memory_type:\"fact\",\n  entities:[{name:\"stp-api\",type:\"Repository\"},{name:\"Hono\",type:\"Technology\"}],\n  relations:[{source:\"stp-api\",type:\"BUILT_WITH\",target:\"Hono\"}]\n});\nreturn JSON.stringify([n1,n2]).slice(0,1200);"} 
