 for both cases.\\nMajor PostgreSQL upgrades must plan pg_upgrade or dump/restore into a NEW major version volume — never aim a new major image at the old data volume.`,\n  tags: \"seatap,docker,compose,secrets,runbook\",\n  memory_type: \"fact\",\n  entities: [\n    { name: \"Seatap\", type: \"Project\" },\n    { name: \"Docker Compose\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"Cloudflare Tunnel\", type: \"Technology\" }\n  ]\n});\nreturn JSON.stringify(a).slice(0,600) + \" ||| \" + JSON.stringify(b).slice(0,600);"} 
