[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"const res = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment: \"work\",\n  project: \"inline-design\",\n  title: \"ECW-in-WASM spike confirms gdal3.js cannot decode ECW; Hexagon SDK path is login-gated\",\n  memory_type: \"learning\",\n  tags: \"ecw, wasm, gdal, gdal3js, hexagon, image-import, spike\",\n  links: \"01-Work/inline-design/202610280513-ecw-decode-in-wasm-is-possible-only-with-proprietary-hexagon.md, 01-Work/inline-design/202610280508-inline-design-accepts-only-jpeg-png-photos-not-ecw-orthomosa.md\",\n  entities: [\n    { name: \"Inline Design\", type: \"Project\" },\n    { name: \"ECW\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"gdal3.js\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"Hexagon ECW SDK\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"WebAssembly\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"GDAL\", type: \"Technology\" }\n  ],\n  relations: [\n    { source: \"gdal3.js\", type: \"EXCLUDES\", target: \"ECW\", quote: \"has ECW: false ... has JP2ECW: false\" },\n    { source: \"ECW\", type: \"REQUIRES\", target: \"Hexagon ECW SDK\", quote: \"blocker is proprietary: need ECW SDK source + redistribution EULA\" },\n    { source: \"Inline Design\", type: \"DEPENDS_ON\", target: \"WebAssembly\", quote: \"current build is wasm-pack --target web Rust 1.99.1\" }\n  ],\n  body: `Ran a throwaway spike in \\`/private/tmp/opencode/ecw-spike/\\` to settle whether ECW orthomosaics can be decoded in the browser.\nReference GDAL-WASM build \\`gdal3.js@2.8.1\\` (Emscripten 3.1.51, GDAL 3.8.4): 27 MB .wasm + 11 MB .data, 128 raster drivers, but \\`has ECW: false\\`, \\`has JP2ECW: false\\`; \\`strings\\` on the wasm shows only stubs (\"JP2ECW detected but ECW_ENCODE_KEY not set\"). GTiff/PNG/JPEG work via \\`/vsimem/\\`.\nA real 98 KB GeoTools \\`sample.ecw\\` fails to open in the browser decoder — consistent, no dataset, no crash recovery.\nHexagon SDK download requires a vendor login and v6.x reportedly gates even read-only use via reseller, so the SDK cannot be fetched unattended.\nThe repo's current build path is \\`wasm-pack --target web\\` (Rust 1.99.1 → 1.1 MB \\`cad_engine_bg.wasm\\`, \\`scripts/build-wasm.mjs\\`), not Emscripten; no \\`emcc\\`/\\`gdalinfo\\` locally.\nVerdict: WASM itself is not the limit — the blocker is proprietary SDK access plus a separate Emscripten toolchain alongside the Rust flow; estimated cost +38 MB PWA precache, tiled \\`/vsimem/\\` Worker decode, COOP/CSP rework, 512 MB heap / 32 MP preflight redesign.\nFallback option kept open: support COG/GeoTIFF via \\`geotiff.js\\` first and document ECW as pre-convert (\\`gdal_translate -of JPEG\\`).`\n});\nreturn res;"} 
