[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"const n = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment: \"work\",\n  project: \"inline-design\",\n  title: \"No free web-based ECW parser exists; cloud converters violate the no-upload rule\",\n  memory_type: \"learning\",\n  tags: \"ecw,drone-imagery,image-import,privacy,tooling\",\n  links: \"01-Work/inline-design/202610280508-inline-design-accepts-only-jpeg-png-photos-not-ecw-orthomosa.md,01-Work/inline-design/202610280513-ecw-decode-in-wasm-is-possible-only-with-proprietary-hexagon.md\",\n  entities: [\n    { name: \"Inline Design\", type: \"Project\" },\n    { name: \"ECW\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"QGIS\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"ER Viewer\", type: \"Technology\" },\n    { name: \"Cloud file conversion services\", type: \"Topic\" }\n  ],\n  relations: [\n    { source: \"Inline Design\", type: \"EXCLUDES\", target: \"Cloud file conversion services\" },\n    { source: \"ECW\", type: \"REQUIRES\", target: \"QGIS\" }\n  ],\n  body: \"Checked for a free web app that parses/decode ECW (Oct 2026): none exists. `gdal3.js` exposes ~128 drivers with no ECW, and the legacy `libecwj2-3.3` (2006) predates ECW v3.\\nThe only free \\\"web\\\" options are cloud converter sites (Convertio, FileProInfo, Filext) that upload the file to their servers, size-limited — disqualified for Inline Design by the `PRD.md:62` no-upload rule for drone imagery.\\nFree offline path: open the `.ecw` in QGIS with the ECW plugin (OSGeo4W build) or ER Viewer freeware, export JPEG/PNG, then import that into the app (`gdal_translate -of JPEG` also works where GDAL has the ECW driver).\\nEmbedding decode in-app still requires the proprietary Hexagon SDK, so there is no drop-in free JS library.\"\n});\nreturn n;"} 
