[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"const a = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment: \"work\",\n  project: \"inline-design\",\n  title: \"Inline Design now has a Go ECW upload + extraction backend (reverses no-server-conversion)\",\n  body: `Status: /Users/azizf/Development/inline-design is now a contract-first Go backend (contracts/openapi.yaml 3.0.3 → oapi-codegen) that accepts ECW server-side and dispatches one allfab/gdal-ecw:3.12.3 container per job.\nFlow: POST /api/v1/files (small) or chunked session POST /api/v1/uploads → PUT .../chunks/{i} with Content-Range → POST .../complete → POST /api/v1/extractions → poll → download GeoTIFF.\nChunked defaults: 8 MiB chunks (1.8 GB ≈ 226), idempotent and order-independent, GET session returns a received bitmap for resume, complete assembles in order, validates ECW, dedupes by SHA-256.\nVerified: go build/vet/test green, no oapi-codegen drift, live smoke on :18080 (3 MB fake ECW, reversed + retried chunks → SUCCEEDED, idempotent replay returned same job_id).\nOpen: Postgres repos + migration exist but the PG path is untested in this workspace; first docker compose up should confirm -migrate-up. Without Postgres/Docker it falls back to memory repos + fake runner.\nSupersedes the 2026-10-28 \"local-only, no server conversion\" ECW import decision: a server decode path now exists and is the documented production path.`,\n  metadata: {\n    memory_type: \"decision\",\n    entities: [\n      {name: \"Inline Design\", type: \"Project\"},\n      {name: \"ECW\", type: \"Technology\"},\n      {name: \"Go\", type: \"Technology\"},\n      {name: \"allfab/gdal-ecw\", type: \"Technology\"}\n    ],\n    relations: [\n      {source: \"Inline Design\", type: \"USES\", target: \"Go\"},\n      {source: \"Inline Design\", type: \"DEPENDS_ON\", target: \"allfab/gdal-ecw\"},\n      {source: \"Inline Design\", type: \"USES\", target: \"ECW\"}\n    ],\n    supersedes: \"202610280559-ecw-import-decision-local-only-staging-now-wasm-decode-block\",\n    reason: \"A Go backend with server-side ECW upload and gdal-ecw container extraction was implemented and smoke-tested; the earlier no-server-conversion decision no longer holds.\",\n    links: [\"01-Work/inline-design/202610280559-ecw-import-decision-local-only-staging-now-wasm-decode-block.md\"],\n    tags: [\"ecw\", \"backend\", \"go\", \"openapi\", \"upload\", \"supersede\"]\n  }\n});\nreturn a;"} 
