    "content": "---\nid: 202610290804\ntitle: go:embed rejects ../ paths, so inline-design viewer assets use a directory scan\nsegment: work\nproject: inline-design\ntags: [inline-design, go, go-embed, build, gotcha]\ncreated: 2026-10-29\nmemory_type: learning\nentities: [{\"type\": \"Project\", \"name\": \"inline-design\"}, {\"type\": \"Technology\", \"name\": \"Go\"}, {\"type\": \"Project\", \"name\": \"viewer\", \"origin\": \"llm\"}]\nrelations: [{\"source\": \"inline-design\", \"type\": \"USES\", \"target\": \"Go\", \"quote\": \"Baking the viewer into the inline-design api image with `go:embed ../../viewer/...` failed: embed patterns may not contain `..`.\", \"origin\": \"llm\"}]\n---\n\nBaking the viewer into the inline-design api image with `go:embed ../../viewer/...` failed: embed patterns may not contain `..`.\nFix: embed the directory and scan it at runtime instead of referencing parent-relative paths.\nAlternative when scanning is unwanted: copy the assets into the package dir before build.\n\nRelated: [[01-Work/inline-design/202610290801-inline-design-on-asus-uses-an-app-port-knob-because-8080-808.md]]\n\nRelated: [[01-Work/inline-design/202610290801-inline-design-on-asus-uses-an-app-port-knob-because-8080-808.md]]\n\nParent: [[01-Work/inline-design/inline-design|inline-design]]\n",
