[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"const res = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment: \"personal\",\n  area: \"Developer tooling\",\n  memory_type: \"decision\",\n  title: \"Lightweight Hermes replacement: Discord front-door, SQLite board, code-only dispatcher\",\n  tags: [\"opencode\", \"kanban\", \"discord\", \"orchestration\", \"hermes\"],\n  body: `Aziz wants Hermes' capability without its token cost: a Discord bot he can talk to, spawn as many bots as he wants, and a workflow that carries each task start-to-end.\n\nChosen shape (replacing Hermes plugins/skills/profile memory):\n- Front-door: discord.js gateway with commands !task/!board/!kill; no LLM in the loop.\n- Board: SQLite tasks(id, title, body, assignee, status[todo|ready|running|review|done|blocked], worktree, session_id, parents[], artifacts_json) + events.\n- Dispatcher: plain TS/Python tick (~5s) that promotes todo->ready when parents[] done; 0 coordination tokens.\n- Workers: opencode run --attach against one shared opencode serve :4096, each in its own git worktree; worker prompt ~15 lines and never sees the full board.\n- Workflow: workflow.yaml stages decompose -> implement -> verify(gate lint/test) -> merge (merge is code, no LLM).\n- Token caps: workers deny webfetch/websearch/skill and all MCP; second_brain+context7 only on orchestrator; steps 30-50; cheap *-free:low models for implement.\n\nOpen questions left with Aziz: pilot repo, max parallel bots, dispatcher language (TS vs Python).`,\n  links: [\n    \"00-Personal/Developer tooling/202611011158-hermes-kanban-rejected-as-too-token-heavy-for-local-agent-or.md\",\n    \"00-Personal/Developer tooling/202611011158-opencode-kanban-collaboration-orchestrator-owned-dispatch-no.md\"\n  ],\n  entities: [\n    { type: \"Technology\", name: \"OpenCode\" },\n    { type: \"Technology\", name: \"Discord\" },\n    { type: \"Technology\", name: \"SQLite\" },\n    { type: \"System\", name: \"Hermes Kanban\" },\n    { type: \"Topic\", name: \"Agent orchestration\" }\n  ],\n  relations: [\n    { source: \"Discord\", type: \"INTEGRATES_WITH\", target: \"OpenCode\" },\n    { source: \"SQLite\", type: \"STORES\", target: \"Agent orchestration\" }\n  ]\n});\nreturn JSON.stringify(res);"} 
