[0m⚙ [0mexecute {"code":"const r = await tools.second_brain.create_note({\n  segment: \"personal\",\n  area: \"Developer tooling\",\n  title: \"Memory recall exposed as an agent tool, not a chat command\",\n  body: `Aziz rejected \\`!recall\\` as a chat command: chats must stay natural and the agent should recall on its own judgment when the conversation references something outside the visible window. Implemented (commit 16e192f):\n\n- Global opencode tool \\`opencode-tools/recall.ts\\`, symlinked to \\`~/.config/opencode/tools/recall.ts\\`. It reads \\`context.sessionID\\` straight from the custom-tool context, so no scope plumbing on the agent side.\n- Discord bot serves the lookup at \\`127.0.0.1:4137/recall\\`, resolving session->scope via \\`data/scopes/by-session/\\` and searching entries older than the window plus the parent channel for thread replies. Unmapped sessions return \\`(no linked Discord memory)\\`, so normal TUI sessions are unaffected.\n- \\`prompts/default.md\\` gained a short Memory section telling the agent when to call \\`recall\\` instead of asking the user to repeat.\n- Auto-injected recall context removed: no tokens spent unless the tool is actually called.\n- Gotchas: the tool only loads when \\`opencode serve\\` (re)starts; \\`AGENTS_RECALL_URL\\` overrides the endpoint/port.`,\n  tags: [\"opencode\", \"recall\", \"memory\", \"discord\", \"custom-tools\"],\n  memory_type: \"decision\",\n  entities: [\n    {name:\"OpenCode recall tool\", type:\"System\"},\n    {name:\"OpenCode\", type:\"Technology\"},\n    {name:\"Discord bot\", type:\"System\"},\n    {name:\"Aziz\", type:\"Person\"}\n  ],\n  relations: [\n    {source:\"OpenCode recall tool\", type:\"INTEGRATES_WITH\", target:\"Discord bot\", quote:\"Discord bot serves the lookup at 127.0.0.1:4137/recall\"},\n    {source:\"OpenCode recall tool\", type:\"RUNS_ON\", target:\"OpenCode\", quote:\"Global opencode tool opencode-tools/recall.ts\"}\n  ],\n  links: [\"00-Personal/Developer tooling/202611011412-lightweight-hermes-replacement-discord-front-door-sqlite-boa.md\"]\n});\nreturn r;"} 
