S\", target: \"Discord\"},\n    {source: \"Nightly Dev\", type: \"USES\", target: \"OpenCode recall tool\"}\n  ],\n  tags: [\"nightly-dev\",\"discord-bot\",\"agents\",\"persona\",\"pm\"]\n});\nreturn r;"} 
